{"schema":"literary-friend.reference-page.v1","originalPath":"assets/fontforge-reference/doc/sphinx/olddocs/old/ja/AA-Comparison.html","title":"アンチエイリアスの比較","sourceSha256":"2477922ce0a25932f7d3e75c4885aba9d53106460ad79416cfe57ff344a21cf3","headingIndex":[],"scripts":[],"styles":[],"documentTree":[{"tag":"html","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"head","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":" Created with AOLpress/2.0 "},"\n",{"comment":" AP: Created on: 26-Feb-2001 "},"\n",{"comment":" AP: Last modified: 26-Feb-2001 "},"\n",{"tag":"meta","attributes":{"http-equiv":"Content-Type","content":"text/html; charset=utf-8"},"children":[]},"\n",{"tag":"link","attributes":{"rel":"icon","href":"../../_static/fftype16.png"},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"<TITLE>Anti-Alias Comparison</TITLE> "},"\n",{"tag":"title","attributes":{},"children":["アンチエイリアスの比較"]},"\n",{"tag":"link","attributes":{"rel":"stylesheet","type":"text/css","href":"FontForge.css"},"children":[]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"body","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"div","attributes":{"id":"in"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"table","attributes":{"border":"","cellpadding":"2"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/AmbrosiaFV-bm.png","width":"423","height":"226"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  Bitmap display in font view.</TD> "},"\n      フォントビューのビットマップ表示"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"AmbrosiaFV.png","width":"423","height":"234"},"children":[]},{"tag":"br","attributes":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"comment":"  Anti-Aliased (Greymap) display in font view.</TD> "},"\n      アンチエイリアス処理された (グレイマップ) フォントビューの表示"]}]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"\nAt screen pixel sizes the rasterizer has trouble rendering some of the finer\ndetails, but with anti-alias turned on the results are much better. In the\n\"H\" below, the one on the left (bitmap) does not show the double horizontal\nbar of the H very well, while it is well rendered in the one on the right.\nThe results are more extreme in the example above. "},"\n画面のピクセルサイズでは、細部の微妙な形の一部はうまく表示できませんが、アンチエイリアスを使用して調整すると、結果はずっと良くなります。\n下の“H”では、左側 (ビットマップ) は 2 個の水平バーをうまく表示できていませんが、右側では美しくレンダリングされています。\n上の例では、結果はより極端です。\n"]},{"tag":"table","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/H-bm.png","width":"46","height":"50"},"children":[]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"../../_images/H-gm.png","width":"48","height":"50"},"children":[]}]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n"]},{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n— ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"overview.page.json","hrefOriginal":"overview.html"},"children":["目次"]}," — ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"fontview.page.json","hrefOriginal":"fontview.html"},"children":["戻る"]}," —\n"]}]},"\n"]}]},"\n"]}